      ],
      "source": "https://itchol.com/article/russellville-ky-interesting-facts-famous-things-history-information"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Russellville became a flashpoint where conflicting loyalties clashed, leaving a legacy of divided memories.",
